{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_06_beg","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_06","title":"骷髅之舞","storyCode":"LE-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2e7ca67aad6d85c803c4faa23f6269feaa1ac68cf63f02a6bbf3516d85d1e968","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g12_sewer"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人在幽暗而宽阔的下水道里前行。\n水声聒噪，却比纯粹的寂静更让人觉得阴气森森。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别往前走了，这里右拐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很熟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"密探的基本功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基本中的基本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你在夕照区已经干了很多年了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想套近乎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是保密事项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边有什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想靠这种老掉牙的把戏脱身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是——你看那边，有东西在动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别格勒用手中的武器抵住乌提卡伯爵的后心，然后朝伯爵手指的方向看去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是源石虫而已。源石虫你都没见过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......只是源石虫吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堂堂乌提卡伯爵，居然被源石虫吓得走不动路，我也算是长见识了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是觉得有点不对劲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别傻了，赶紧走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个源石虫的数量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这绝对不正常！会出大事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑起来！快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经要来不及了！赶快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别格勒紧紧抓着黑键的手腕，两人在下水道里飞跑起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你脑子里是装了下水道的地图吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时间跟我阴阳怪气，还不如多喘几口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是阴、阴阳怪气，我是真觉得每条岔路长得都一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休息好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着跑！跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喘息声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不行了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我们也找到了该找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，拉赫曼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，别格勒店长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"店长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，您自己什么都不知道，又什么都想掺和一脚，真是麻烦死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说是吧，别格勒店长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你才是现在最大的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的源石虫显然受到了你的刺激，正在往地面上涌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我都知道，下水道里的源石虫会散发有毒的臭气，你在做的事情对夕照区的感染者来说无异于一场毒气袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毒气袭击？可我们两个不是好好的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种气体对感染者的效果比对你强多了，乌提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，车尔尼、芙蓉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩也......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，你已经明白情况了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉赫曼，马上安抚这些源石虫，让它们恢复原状，否则我有权直接将你击毙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人可以轻轻松松引发火灾，但你就算把刀架在他脖子上，也不可能让他独自把大火扑灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样做对你们有什么好处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好处？您连这点事都不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟我打哑谜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还需要我一个词一个词地帮您解释吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以说，让那个预言成真，对你们有什么好处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就不劳您费心了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么？灭口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是击昏他，我亲爱的眼神不好的密探先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有控制源石虫的办法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我有，就不用跟他废话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们赶紧走，晚了就怕来不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（锐利的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人不可貌相啊，乌提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我去把他背起来，你跟着我跑出去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那个是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"顺着别格勒的视线，黑键也看到了。\n拉赫曼倒下的地方，下水道的墙壁上，有什么银色的东西正闪着光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是钥匙孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里面也许是驱动源石虫的什么装置！我来把门轰开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先让我试试能不能把锁撬开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一你轰坏了什么重要的东西，那就糟了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能打开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这锁很难开，但还难不倒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你能不能趁开锁时行行好，告诉我，预言的内容究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没听过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，反正已经传开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越过高高的山岗，恶魔踏入黄昏的中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血中的恶疾隐伏，款款招来蔓延的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终曲的合奏消散，灾祸带走最后的阳光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......合奏......灾祸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我到现在都很好奇最后一句是什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面都已经很明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一句是罗德岛的芙蓉来到夕照区，第二句是假愈现象蔓延......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你连这个都知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为密探的工作是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在第三句也明白了，差的就只有最后一句——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实验室？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是你啊。主持工作辛苦你了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，外面现在已经乱成一锅粥了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下水道里冒出了一波又一波散发臭气的源石虫，好多人中了毒，街上已经全乱套了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多人都把这当成预言的一部分，现在夕照区已经人心惶惶了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会有这种事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人心惶惶先不论，那些被熏倒的人情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是很乐观......尤其是最近矿石病有好转的那些人，反应都很剧烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经在联系医院了，但那些医院的接线员一听说是夕照区的事，都不是很积极......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不积极？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就出门去和那些医院交涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面现在很危险，您还是打电话吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们打的电话他们不积极，我光是打打电话也不可能有什么用，这事必须得我本人出马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礼貌的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就是音乐会了，如果您也中了毒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是因为这种莫名其妙的事件出现了伤亡，就算音乐会如期举行，还能有人全心全意享受音乐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想事情发展到那一步，更不想假装什么都没发生，一边欺骗自己，一边强颜欢笑地弹奏哪怕一个和弦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这么多源石虫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神经质的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好臭！这什么味道啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我扶着你，咱们赶紧跑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神经质的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来......预言是真的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的虫子，别过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克劳泽，克劳泽！站起来——咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救命！来人啊，谁来救救我们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴声......源石虫往声音传来的方向去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，过路人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克劳泽，起来，扶着我的肩膀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神经质的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扶着我，我们快走吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）不客气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"以白垩为中心，大提琴声沿着夕照区狭窄的街巷蔓延开去。\n琴声所到之处，源石虫纷纷调转方向。\n那些被包围的人们以为事情就此了结，喷吐毒雾的虫豸会在琴声的指引下回到阴暗的沟渠里。\n但他们错了。\n在他们看得到的地方，看不到的地方，源石虫都朝着白垩的方向涌去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼、呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于......出来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......怎么办，直接用法术炸翻这些虫子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又怎么不对劲了，我亲爱的密探先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石虫在朝一个地方汇集——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴声......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你在做什么？快停下——咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别喊了，没用的，对你的呼吸系统也不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我一把，让我过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说了别喊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不会因为你喊就停下，我也不会因为你不喊就袖手旁观。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们两个合力打开一条通道，往白垩的方向去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行。我会往你的反方向行进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要回你的咖啡店？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没错。我们合力在这里打开一个空缺，之后就分道扬镳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回你的咖啡店，研究那些在实验室里发现的破纸，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢天谢地，尘世之音的研究笔记可比源石虫毒气的受害者更令人感兴趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的事是你自己惹出来的，你自己解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再有，如果我发现那些研究笔记和计划书里有一笔是你写的，你就等着吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闲话到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别格勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我数到三，我们一起动手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
